CharaROM
===========

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Android/CharaROM, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the CharaROM trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/CharaROM/android.git -b 16.0 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```
Please see the [LineageOS Wiki](https://wiki.lineageos.org/) for building instructions, by device. After all, we are LineageOS at the core!


Submitting patches
------------------
We don't have a system for submitting patches at the moment, but feel free to open an issue with any suggested patch ideas.

